+
+This is intentionally malformed regression data, not a font for installation or
+normal UI rendering. The font remains under SIL OFL-1.1. The generator's Python
+code has a separate MIT license. Original Microsoft copyright, Reserved Font
+Name declaration, trademark, designer and license metadata are retained.
