+6cc35dbfae7d604d5c08cd1a695b927c769f6cb3 as
+opentype/api/font/test/Selawik-VF-Subset.ttf. That commit documents subsetting the
+glyf table while retaining variation tables for TestInvalidGVAR. The later move
+to font/testdata preserves the same blob. No earlier generation procedure or
+permission to use a Reserved Font Name for that historical subset is asserted.
+
+Vellum changes only primary name records 1, 3, 4 and 6 to distinct Vellum names.
+The other 22 name records retain their exact platform/encoding/language/ID and
